{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45397","headline":"湛处士枸杞架歌 · 皎然","name":"湛处士枸杞架歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天生灵草生灵地，误生人间人不贵。\n独君井上有一根，始觉人间衆芳草。\n拖线垂丝宜曙看，裴回满架何珊珊。\n春风亦解爱此物，褭褭时来傍香实。\n湿云缀叶摆不去，翠羽衔花惊畏失。\n肯羡孤松不凋色，皇天正气肃不得。\n我独全生异此辈，顺时荣落不相背。\n孤松自被斧斤伤，独我柔枝保无害。\n黄油酒囊石棊局，吾羡湛生心出俗。\n撷芳生影风洒怀，其致翛然此中足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}